<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Memories, Dreams, Reflections — Carl Jung</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+Thai:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Serif:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      /* === JUNG PALETTE — Midnight Depth + Sacred Gold === */
      --accent:       #5C4499;
      --accent-deep:  #3D2B6B;
      --accent-light: #8B72CC;
      --accent-rule:  rgba(92, 68, 153, 0.30);
      --accent-bg:    rgba(92, 68, 153, 0.08);

      /* === Paper Tones === */
      --paper:        #F2EFE4;
      --paper-mid:    #EAE5D2;
      --paper-deep:   #DDD7BD;
      --paper-shadow: #C8C0A0;
      --ink:          #14110B;
      --ink-soft:     #2A261C;
      --ink-mid:      #46402F;
      --ink-muted:    #7C7460;
      --ink-faint:    #ABA48C;

      /* === Semantic === */
      --red:          #7A1A1A;
      --red-bg:       #FBF3F0;
      --green:        #355E40;
      --green-bg:     #F1F6EE;

      /* === Layout === */
      --book-width:   760px;
      --page-pad-h:   76px;
      --page-pad-v:   84px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background: #0D0A14;
      padding: 40px 16px;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
    }

    .book {
      max-width: var(--book-width);
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--paper);
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.10),
        0 4px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.60),
        0 0 120px rgba(92,68,153,.15);
    }

    /* =============================================
       COVER
    ============================================= */
    .cover {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0D0A14 0%, #1A1230 40%, #0D0A14 100%);
      padding: 80px var(--page-pad-h) 72px;
      min-height: 640px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cover::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 0%, rgba(92,68,153,.25) 0%, transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 80% 80%, rgba(184,134,11,.10) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .cover-ornament {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      opacity: .7;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .cover-symbol {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 52px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      opacity: .85;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(92,68,153,.6));
    }
    .cover-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 52px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #F2EFE4;
      line-height: 1.15;
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .cover-title em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: #C9A84C;
      display: block;
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .cover-rule {
      width: 60px;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #C9A84C, transparent);
      margin: 32px auto;
    }
    .cover-sub {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(242,239,228,.45);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cover-author {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: rgba(201,168,76,.80);
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .cover-corner {
      position: absolute;
      width: 56px; height: 56px;
      border-color: rgba(201,168,76,.25);
      border-style: solid;
    }
    .cover-corner.tl { top: 28px; left: 28px; border-width: 1px 0 0 1px; }
    .cover-corner.tr { top: 28px; right: 28px; border-width: 1px 1px 0 0; }
    .cover-corner.bl { bottom: 28px; left: 28px; border-width: 0 0 1px 1px; }
    .cover-corner.br { bottom: 28px; right: 28px; border-width: 0 1px 1px 0; }

    /* =============================================
       TOC
    ============================================= */
    .toc-page {
      background: var(--paper-mid);
      padding: var(--page-pad-v) var(--page-pad-h);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-shadow);
    }
    .toc-label {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .toc-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .ch-card { display: flex; gap: 20px; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-shadow); align-items: flex-start; }
    .ch-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .ch-card-num { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 36px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; min-width: 52px; padding-top: 4px; }
    .ch-card-title { font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .ch-card-one-liner { font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-muted); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .ch-tag { display: inline-block; font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; background: var(--accent-bg); color: var(--accent-deep); padding: 3px 8px; margin-right: 6px; font-weight: 600; }

    /* =============================================
       FOREWORD / LETTER
    ============================================= */
    .letter-page {
      padding: var(--page-pad-v) var(--page-pad-h);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-shadow);
    }
    .letter-label {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .letter-greeting {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .letter-body p {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.95;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .letter-sig {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-shadow);
    }

    /* =============================================
       CHAPTER OPENING
    ============================================= */
    .chapter-open {
      background: var(--paper-mid);
      padding: var(--page-pad-v) var(--page-pad-h);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-shadow);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .ch-num {
      position: absolute;
      right: var(--page-pad-h);
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-60%);
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 180px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: rgba(92,68,153,.06);
      line-height: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .ch-label {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .ch-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      max-width: 480px;
    }
    .ch-title em {
      display: block;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--ink-mid);
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .ch-rule {
      width: 48px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--accent);
      margin: 28px 0;
    }
    .ch-essence {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-style: italic;
      max-width: 420px;
    }

    /* =============================================
       PAGE
    ============================================= */
    .page {
      padding: var(--page-pad-v) var(--page-pad-h);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-shadow);
    }
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .page h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .page h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin-top: 44px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-rule);
    }
    .page p {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 2.0;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .page p strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* === Insight Box === */
    .insight-box {
      background: var(--accent-bg);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 24px 28px;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
    .insight-box .ib-label {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .insight-box p {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      margin: 0;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    /* === Pullquote === */
    .pullquote {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      margin: 36px 0;
      padding: 8px 0 8px 28px;
    }
    .pullquote p {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 21px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    }
    .pullquote cite {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-faint);
      font-style: normal;
    }

    /* === Blockquote Full (Dark) === */
    .blockquote-full {
      background: var(--accent-deep);
      margin: 40px calc(-1 * var(--page-pad-h));
      padding: 56px var(--page-pad-h);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .blockquote-full p {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: rgba(242,239,228,.92);
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .blockquote-full .bq-th {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: rgba(201,168,76,.80);
      font-style: normal;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .blockquote-full cite {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(242,239,228,.35);
      margin-top: 20px;
      display: block;
    }

    /* === Author Box === */
    .author-box {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      background: var(--paper-mid);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      margin: 28px 0;
    }
    .author-avatar {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent-deep);
      color: var(--paper);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 18px; font-style: italic;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .author-meta {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep); margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .author-text {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--ink-soft);
      font-style: italic; margin: 0;
    }
    .author-content { flex: 1; }

    /* === Insight Ladder === */
    .ladder { margin: 32px 0; }
    .ladder-step { padding: 18px 24px; }
    .ladder-step.wrong { background: var(--red-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--red); }
    .ladder-step.truth { background: var(--accent-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-deep); }
    .ladder-step.action { background: var(--green-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--green); }
    .ladder-tag {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .ladder-step.wrong .ladder-tag { color: var(--red); }
    .ladder-step.truth .ladder-tag { color: var(--accent-deep); }
    .ladder-step.action .ladder-tag { color: var(--green); }
    .ladder-text { font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .ladder-arrow { text-align: center; padding: 6px; color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 20px; }

    /* === Reflection === */
    .reflection {
      background: var(--paper-deep);
      border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-rule);
      padding: 28px 32px;
      margin-top: 44px;
    }
    .reflection-label {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-faint); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .reflection ol {
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .reflection li {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--ink-mid);
      margin-bottom: 10px; font-style: italic;
    }

    /* === Checklist === */
    .checklist { margin: 28px 0; }
    .checklist-title {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent-deep); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .check-item {
      display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-shadow);
    }
    .check-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .check-box {
      width: 20px; height: 20px; border: 2px solid var(--accent);
      flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .check-text {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-soft);
    }

    /* === Signal Box === */
    .signal-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0; margin: 32px 0; }
    .signal-box { padding: 22px 24px; }
    .signal-box.warn { background: var(--red-bg); border-top: 3px solid var(--red); }
    .signal-box.go { background: var(--green-bg); border-top: 3px solid var(--green); }
    .signal-label { font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .signal-box.warn .signal-label { color: var(--red); }
    .signal-box.go .signal-label { color: var(--green); }
    .signal-box ul { padding-left: 16px; }
    .signal-box li { font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 6px; }

    /* =============================================
       FOOTER
    ============================================= */
    .book-footer {
      background: var(--ink);
      padding: 56px var(--page-pad-h);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .book-footer-mark {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-style: italic; font-size: 36px;
      color: #C9A84C; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .book-footer-text {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif Thai', serif;
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--paper-deep);
      font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }
    .book-footer-author {
      font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px; color: var(--accent-light);
      letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* =============================================
       RESPONSIVE
    ============================================= */
    @media (max-width: 780px) {
      :root { --page-pad-h: 28px; --page-pad-v: 56px; }
      body { padding: 16px 8px; }
      .ch-num { font-size: 100px; right: 16px; }
      .ch-title { font-size: 32px; }
      .cover-title { font-size: 36px; }
      .cover-title em { font-size: 26px; }
      .blockquote-full { padding: 40px 28px; margin-left: -28px; margin-right: -28px; }
      .blockquote-full p { font-size: 19px; }
      .signal-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .page h1 { font-size: 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="book">

  <!-- =================== COVER =================== -->
  <div class="cover">
    <div class="cover-corner tl"></div>
    <div class="cover-corner tr"></div>
    <div class="cover-corner bl"></div>
    <div class="cover-corner br"></div>

    <div class="cover-ornament">C. G. Jung · 1962</div>

    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="cover-symbol">☽</div>
      <div class="cover-title">
        Memories, Dreams,<br>Reflections
        <em>ความทรงจำ · ความฝัน · การสะท้อนตน</em>
      </div>
      <div class="cover-rule"></div>
      <div class="cover-sub">จากมุมมองภายในของ Carl Gustav Jung</div>
      <div class="cover-author">Carl Gustav Jung</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cover-ornament" style="text-align:right;">
      จิตวิทยาเชิงลึก · อัตชีวประวัติแห่งจิตใจ
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- =================== TOC =================== -->
  <div class="toc-page">
    <div class="toc-label">สารบัญ · Table of Contents</div>
    <div class="toc-title">บทสำรวจจิตใจมนุษย์จากภายใน</div>

    <div class="ch-card">
      <div class="ch-card-num">I</div>
      <div class="ch-card-body">
        <div class="ch-card-title">🧭 แก่นแท้สูงสุด — The Core Realization</div>
        <div class="ch-card-one-liner">ความจริงที่ยิ่งใหญ่ที่สุดที่ฉันค้นพบในชีวิต คืออะไร?</div>
        <div><span class="ch-tag">จิตใจ</span><span class="ch-tag">ชีวิต</span><span class="ch-tag">ความหมาย</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ch-card">
      <div class="ch-card-num">II</div>
      <div class="ch-card-body">
        <div class="ch-card-title">🌑 จิตไร้สำนึก — The Unconscious & Inner World</div>
        <div class="ch-card-one-liner">โลกที่แท้จริงอยู่ข้างในเรา ไม่ใช่ข้างนอก</div>
        <div><span class="ch-tag">unconscious</span><span class="ch-tag">ฝัน</span><span class="ch-tag">สัญลักษณ์</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ch-card">
      <div class="ch-card-num">III</div>
      <div class="ch-card-body">
        <div class="ch-card-title">🔥 Individuation — การเป็นตัวของตัวเองอย่างแท้จริง</div>
        <div class="ch-card-one-liner">การเดินทางสู่ความสมบูรณ์ที่คนส่วนใหญ่ไม่กล้าเผชิญ</div>
        <div><span class="ch-tag">individuation</span><span class="ch-tag">self</span><span class="ch-tag">ความสมบูรณ์</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ch-card">
      <div class="ch-card-num">IV</div>
      <div class="ch-card-body">
        <div class="ch-card-title">🐍 Shadow · Archetypes · Symbols — เงาและต้นแบบ</div>
        <div class="ch-card-one-liner">ส่วนที่เราปฏิเสธในตัวเองคือสิ่งที่ทรงพลังที่สุด</div>
        <div><span class="ch-tag">shadow</span><span class="ch-tag">archetype</span><span class="ch-tag">สัญลักษณ์</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ch-card">
      <div class="ch-card-num">V</div>
